      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Gloomy weather, impending rain and breezy forecast - Great way to kick off the weekend with a short hike. Meena didn&rsquo;t get to see the falls <a href="https://srikanthperinkulam.com/2020/05/15/alberta-road-thru-trail-hike/">last time we were on this trail</a>. So we decided to head back here with Shasta in the carrier. Made it back home just in time before the thunder-storms kicked in.</p>
